    "doc": "call"
   },
   "news_id": "nse-106779959",
   "text": "EBITDA margin fell to 6.2% in Q1FY27 from 9.2% a year ago and 8.4% in Q4FY26."
  },
  {
   "category": "Other",
   "date": "2026-09-14",
   "lab": {
    "at": "2026-09-14",
    "by": "ai",
    "doc": "call"
   },
   "news_id": "nse-106779959",
   "text": "In-house karigars make 82.98% of products in FY26, down from 85% in FY23."
  },
  {
   "category": "Balance sheet & funding",
   "date": "2026-09-14",
   "lab": {
